    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Both these bail applications arise out of the same police case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1126,
      "end": 1189,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Accordingly, both these cases are being disposed of by a common order.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1190,
      "end": 1260,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09071362018585205
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "3. The petitioners have been made accused in connection with Mihijam P.S. Case No. 72/2023, for the offences registered under Sections 420, 467, 506/34 of the I.P.C., pending in the Court of Ms.\nShalika Anna Herenz, learned Judicial Magistrate, 1st Class, Jamtara.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1262,
      "end": 1526,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Mihijam P.S. Case No. 72/2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1323,
          "end": 1352
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 420",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1388,
          "end": 1400
        },
        {
          "text": "467",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1402,
          "end": 1405
        },
        {
          "text": "506/34",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1407,
          "end": 1413
        },
        {
          "text": "I.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1421,
          "end": 1427
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalika Anna Herenz",
          "label": "JUDGE",
          "start": 1457,
          "end": 1476
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10371758788824081
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "4. It is alleged that accused persons including these petitioners lured the informant for purchasing Maruti Dzire car for consideration amount of Rs. 1,60,000/-.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1528,
      "end": 1689,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.0960979089140892
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "They also told him that the purchased car will be hired by the office of Superintendent of Police, Jamtara.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1690,
      "end": 1797,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Jamtara",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1789,
          "end": 1796
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09379906207323074
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The informant paid Rs.\n1,60,000/- to the accused persons.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1798,
      "end": 1855,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16183136403560638
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Subsequently, petitioner was told that the said car has met with an accident and two persons have died in the accident and they have to manage the police.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1856,
      "end": 2010,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10341974347829819
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "They took money from the informant on several occasions.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2011,
      "end": 2067,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1501932144165039
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The informant paid total sum of about Rs.\n76,60,000/- to the accused persons.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2068,
      "end": 2145,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13880151510238647
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "Later on, the informant came to know that he has been cheated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2146,
      "end": 2208,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11767838895320892
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "5. From perusal of the Case Diary, it transpired that money was transferred to the account of the accused persons.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2210,
      "end": 2324,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07781577110290527
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "6. Considering the nature of allegation, I am not inclined to release the petitioners, on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2326,
      "end": 2421,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.05313735082745552
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "Accordingly, their prayer for bail stands rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2422,
      "end": 2474,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
